{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53819","headline":"新妇石 · 白居易","name":"新妇石","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"堂堂不语望夫君，四畔无家石作邻。\n蝉鬓一梳千岁髻，蛾眉长扫万年春。\n雪爲轻粉凭风拂，霞作胭脂使日匀。\n莫道面前无宝监，月来山下照夫人。\n（《咸淳临安志》卷二六。\n以下皆转录自朱金城先生《白居易集笺校》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53819.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53819","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}